        "derivation": "The supplied package declaration and fixture fields permit a package raft test invoking the actual MockSnapshot.Persist. Existing tests demonstrate Create with the maximum snapshot version, empty configuration and an in-memory transport. FileSnapshotSink.Close calls finalize and then writeMeta before rename. Replacing only temporary metadata with a directory forces a real error at the latter boundary; the exact returned PathError identifies that operation. Reaching this error also establishes that finalize returned successfully. A fresh isolated store and sequential calls prevent ID collision or concurrent publication.",
